@startuml F5.18-D02-cache-refresh-relatorios
title F5.18-D02 — Cache HIT + refresh manual
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp

Sec -> WebApp: reabre estatísticas
note right of WebApp
  cache HIT (< 5 min)
  sem HTTP
end note
WebApp --> Sec: gráficos do cache
Sec -> WebApp: Refresh
note right of WebApp
  invalidateQueries
  + Skeleton
end note
WebApp -> WebApp: refetch F5.11-D01
WebApp --> Sec: dados atualizados

@enduml
